  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Cut plain tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm chunks.<br>• In a medium bowl, combine the soy sauce, tofu and half the garlic stir-fry sauce. Set aside. <br>• Trim and roughly chop pea pods. <br>• Thinly slice cucumber into sticks. <br>• Shred baby cos lettuce (see ingredients). <br>• Slice lime into wedges. <br>• In a small bowl, combine mayonnaise, the remaining garlic stir-fry sauce and a squeeze of lime juice. Set aside.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e5a3bf309a3ea2dc0ca10d/step-14618300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.<br>• When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a plate.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e5a3bf309a3ea2dc0ca10d/step-a9887910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts, until warmed through.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e5a3bf309a3ea2dc0ca10d/step-611dba20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Spread each tortilla with some garlic mayo and top with the cos lettuce, pea pods, cucumber and tofu.<br>• Tear over parsley. <br>• Sprinkle with crispy shallots and serve with lime wedges. Enjoy! <br><br>Little cooks: Take the lead and help build the tacos!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e5a3bf309a3ea2dc0ca10d/step-48fa5d30.jpg"
    }
  ]
